GIMP Palette
Name: Gear Overlay Keys
Columns: 5
# The five key grays overlay art is painted in. Each maps to the equipped
# material's ramp stop at the same index. See README.md in this folder.
  0   0   0	step 0 - outline
 64  64  64	step 1 - deep shadow
128 128 128	step 2 - midtone
191 191 191	step 3 - light
255 255 255	step 4 - specular
